<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.1.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .maintenance-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="maintenance-card p-5 text-center">
                    <i class="fas fa-tools fa-4x text-primary mb-4"></i>
                    <h1 class="h2 text-dark mb-3">Estamos em Manutenção</h1>
                    <p class="text-muted mb-4">
                        O nosso site está temporariamente indisponível para melhorias. 
                        Por favor, volte mais tarde.
                    </p>
                    <div class="progress mb-4">
                        <div class="progress-bar progress-bar-striped progress-bar-animated" 
                             style="width: 75%"></div>
                    </div>
                    <small class="text-muted">
                        <i class="fas fa-clock me-1"></i>
                        Tempo estimado: 30 minutos
                    </small>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>